/*!
\page p_platform_support Platform Support

RWMath is officially supported on the following platforms:
- PS3 (both PPU and SPU)
- XBox 360 (VMX128)
- Wii (Paired Instructions)
- PC (SSE)
- Unix (both generic support via the FPU or optionally optimized support via SSE instructions on supporting systems)
- iPhone/iPad/iPod, Android, Playbook, and Palm Pre (Neon support is optionally available)
    - rwmath checks if __ARM_NEON__ is defined to determine whether or not to use arm instructions.
- Vita (Neon)
- Airplay
- Nintendo 3DS
- Freebox (an x86 set-top box)
- Mac OSX (on x86)

*/
